        <mxCell id="Y8riki52rvX06RVPP2TU-10" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;172.16.0.80 ()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;name:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Net-SSH-&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;open ports (from .60): 80&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;hint-8.png: To get the flag for this machine, you will need to look for and connect to the port commonly used for RDP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The flag is the PDU for UDP at the transport layer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;hint-7.png: To get the flag for net-ssh-07, you will need to look for and connect to a port commonly used with leet speak.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="Y8riki52rvX06RVPP2TU-8">
