        <mxCell id="YmWNIQDyPwzzUWuigMx0-7" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;172.16.0.100 (telnet 31117, ssh 311119)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;name:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Net-SSH-10&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;open ports (from 172.16.0.90): 23 80&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The flag for this machine is being sent from net-ssh-09. While logged into net-ssh-10, use tcpdump and ignore telnet traffic to look for the 8 character hidden message being repeated.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="YmWNIQDyPwzzUWuigMx0-5">
